# Research Conventions

## Experiment discipline

- Never modify collected traces, receipts or results after collection.
- Never rerun an experiment with changed parameters under the same name. A
  material change is a new versioned attempt with a new output path.
- Every GPU run uses a digest-pinned Docker image submitted through Slurm.
- Seeds are explicit (`[42, 43, 44]` minimum) and recorded.
- Negative results are recorded with the same care as positive ones.

## Code style

- Python 3.11+, type hints on public functions, ruff for lint and format.

## State protocol

- Current state lives in `program/state.json`; update it when a stage changes.
- Append significant actions to `program/log.md`.
- Old work is read-only under `legacy/` (see `legacy/INDEX.md`).
